          deckDescription: 'One standard 52-card poker deck consisting of four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs), each with thirteen ranks from ace down to two. No jokers; the deck is used to deal private hole cards for Badeucy, a split-pot triple-draw lowball game.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs). Suits have no trump order in Badeucy but matter for building a four-suit Badugi and for avoiding flushes in the Deuce-to-Seven low half of the pot.',
